q BT 65.20 771.39 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (quiet and keep the boy safe, because the boy was the only thing that mattered.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 741.91 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Then Dominic turned fourteen, and his kidneys began to fail.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 712.43 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.956 Tw (The doctors were calm and precise. He needed a transplant. A family member was the best) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 692.02 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.176 Tw (match. Salvatore Benedetti rolled up his sleeve without hesitation, a father doing what fathers) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 671.61 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (do, and the blood tests came back.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 642.13 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Salvatore Benedetti was not Dominic's father.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 612.65 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.152 Tw (The words hung in the hospital corridor like smoke. The doctors spoke in careful, clinical terms.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 592.24 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 2.841 Tw (Blood types. Markers. Probability. What they meant was simple: the man who had raised) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 571.83 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.017 Tw (Dominic, the man whose name the boy carried, the man who owned the house on the hill, shared) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 551.42 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (no blood with him at all.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 521.94 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.572 Tw (Salvatore went very still. Then he looked at Grace, and in his eyes she saw the question he had) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 501.53 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.253 Tw (been afraid to ask for fourteen years. And Grace, who had carried her stone for twelve years,) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 481.12 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (finally set it down.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 451.64 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.141 Tw ("I knew," she said. "I have always known. He is my brother's son. Anthony Russo's son. You) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 431.23 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.583 Tw (killed my brother, Salvatore. You took his child, and you raised him as your own, and you told) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 410.83 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.454 Tw (the world his mother died. She did not die. You sent her away, and you kept the boy, because a) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 390.42 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (son is an heir, and an heir is power.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 360.94 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.152 Tw (The corridor went silent. Nurses stopped walking. Somewhere down the hall, a machine beeped,) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 340.53 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (steady and indifferent.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 311.05 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.040 Tw (Salvatore Benedetti looked at the woman who had raised his son for twelve years, and for the) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 290.64 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.291 Tw (first time in his life, he had nothing to say. Then Dominic stepped out of his hospital room, pale) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 270.23 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.617 Tw (and thin in his gown, and he looked from his father to his nanny, and he said, "Gracie. Tell me) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 249.82 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (everything.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 220.34 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.409 Tw (So she did. She told him about Anthony Russo, the laughing young man in the photograph. She) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 199.93 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.368 Tw (told him about the friendship, and the betrayal, and the night her brother died. She told him that) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 179.52 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.976 Tw (his mother was alive, living under another name in another city, waiting for the day she could) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 159.11 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.875 Tw (see her son again. And she told him that she had stayed in that house for twelve years, not for) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 138.70 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (the money, but to be near the last living piece of her brother.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 109.22 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.840 Tw (Dominic listened to all of it. He did not cry. He took Grace's hand, and he looked at Salvatore) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 88.81 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.650 Tw (Benedetti, and he said, "You lied to me for fourteen years. You killed my father. You stole my) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 68.40 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (mother. I am not your son, and I am not your heir.") Tj ET Q
