q BT 65.20 750.98 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.351 Tw (together, in the dark, while Salvatore Benedetti stood at the top of the stairs and watched the) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 730.57 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (only two people he had ever loved walk out of his life.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 701.09 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 2.694 Tw (The transplant came from an anonymous donor three weeks later. Dominic recovered. His) Tj ET Q
