q BT 65.20 639.86 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (the family she had been protecting all along.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 610.38 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.584 Tw (Salvatore Benedetti still lives in the house on the hill. The gates are still locked. The rooms are) Tj ET Q
